          },
          {
            "title": "Strings and number variables",
            "id": 126569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir dizeye sayı eklemek, sayısal bir değer yerine sayı depolayan <code>score</code> gibi bir değişken kullandığımızda da çalışır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Your score: \\(score)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"result\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your score: 99\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>score</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
